{
  "about": "A voice refusal describes the state it was made in (docs/design/voice-notes.md §8): the module's busy, said when another caller started recording between two reads of voice_status, goes once voice_status moves on (that recording ended); a Send refused as room-changed goes once another room is open. voiceJson and voiceResultJson are copied from the shapes voice_status and the voice methods pin (no runner records one until S9).",
